        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TD\n    %% Direct Inline Color Assignments\n    Start([🚚 Supplier Arrives at Center])\n    \n    OptionA[📝 Option A: Manual Input of Targets]\n    OptionB[📊 Option B: Paste Approved Excel Market Order]\n    AlignTable[⚙️ HTML Parser: Map to Lots 1-5 Master Table]\n    \n    Dietary[🍳 Dietary Service Portal:&lt;br/&gt;Inspects Food Quality &amp; Freshness]\n    OD[👮 Officer of the Day OD/EOD Portal:&lt;br/&gt;Counts, Weighs &amp; Logs Quantities]\n    Admin[💼 Administrative Service Dashboard:&lt;br/&gt;Manage Records &amp; Review Form Fields]\n    \n    VerifyCaps{Do actual delivery counts&lt;br/&gt;match approved targets?}\n    \n    FlagShortage[🚨 Log Delivery Variance:&lt;br/&gt;Isolate Undelivered Items]\n    FulfillQueue[📌 Save Pending Fulfillment Request&lt;br/&gt;for Next Delivery Cycle]\n    \n    DB[(🔥 Cloud Firestore Database:&lt;br/&gt;Logs, Backorders &amp; Activity Buffers)]\n    GenDocs[📄 Auto-Populate Values for:&lt;br/&gt;IAR &amp; RIS Forms]\n    \n    End([🏁 Processing Completed])\n\n    %% DSWD Blue Blocks (Primary Workflow)\n    style Start fill:#0F2C59,stroke:#0A1D3A,stroke-width:2px,color:#FFF\n    style Dietary fill:#1E40AF,stroke:#1D4ED8,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#FFF\n    style OD fill:#1E40AF,stroke:#1D4ED8,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#FFF\n    style Admin fill:#1E40AF,stroke:#1D4ED8,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#FFF\n    style AlignTable fill:#0F2C59,stroke:#0A1D3A,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#FFF\n    style GenDocs fill:#1E40AF,stroke:#1D4ED8,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#FFF\n    style End fill:#0F2C59,stroke:#0A1D3A,stroke-width:2px,color:#FFF\n\n    %% DSWD Red Blocks (Shorted Deliveries / Warnings)\n    style FlagShortage fill:#A71D2A,stroke:#7A111A,stroke-width:2px,color:#FFF\n    style FulfillQueue fill:#A71D2A,stroke:#7A111A,stroke-width:2px,color:#FFF\n\n    %% Input and Processing Blocks\n    style OptionA fill:#F8FAFC,stroke:#94A3B8,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#1E293B\n    style OptionB fill:#F8FAFC,stroke:#94A3B8,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#1E293B\n    style VerifyCaps fill:#FFFBEB,stroke:#D97706,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#78350F\n    style DB fill:#E8F8F5,stroke:#117A65,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#117A65\n\n    %% Connections\n    OptionA &amp; OptionB --&gt; AlignTable\n    AlignTable --&gt; |Establishes Baseline Reference Values| VerifyCaps\n    \n    Start --&gt; Dietary\n    Dietary --&gt; |Passes Quality &amp; Freshness Check| OD\n    OD --&gt; |Logs Physical Quantity &amp; Weight| Admin\n    Admin --&gt; |Submits to Validation Engine| VerifyCaps\n    \n    %% Logic Routes\n    VerifyCaps --&gt;|Shortage / Missing Items| FlagShortage\n    VerifyCaps --&gt;|Delivery Matches Target| DB\n    \n    FlagShortage --&gt; FulfillQueue\n    FulfillQueue --&gt; DB\n    \n    DB --&gt; GenDocs\n    GenDocs --&gt; End\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="X4LRk73sphEZwG5tWp54-32">
